<title>USA: Maytag Co Q3 net, sales higher. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</title>
<headline>Maytag Co Q3 net, sales higher. [CORRECTED 14:45 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEWTON, Iowa 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			 $ 0.40		   $ 0.26</p>
<p> Net			 40,630		   27,946</p>
<p> Revs		     742,850		  726,371</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 100,793		  107,312</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 Q3 and 1995 Q3 net each include $0.02 charge from early retirement of debt. 1995 Q3 net also includes pre-tax charge of $16.5 million from settlement of lawsuit.</p>
<p>(Corrects from &quot;gain of $16.5 million&quot;).</p>
<p>	  NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr profit	     $  0.98     loss	$ 0.35</p>
<p> Net profit	     101,091     loss	37,092</p>
<p> Revs		   2,228,715		2,349,983</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 102,709		  107,053</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 nine months net includes pre-tax restructuring charge of $40 million and loss on early retirement of debt of $1.5 million, or $0.02 a share.</p>
<p>1995 nine months net includes pre-tax charge of $16.5 million from settlement of lawsuit, and loss on early retirement of debt of $5.5 million, or $0.05 a share.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312 408 8787</p>
</text>
